### Expected end-to-end improvement

| Optimization | Estimated saving |
|---|---|
| Compress system prompt | 4–8s |
| Reduce max_tokens 1024→256 | 2–5s |
| Reduce history window | 1–3s |
| Regex fast-path (when matched) | 10–20s (skips LLM entirely) |
| Ollama probe TTL cache | 0–3s |
| Reduce MAX_AGENT_STEPS 4→2 | 0–15s (when followup triggered) |

**Total: 7–54s savings depending on query type. Simple queries (stats, vpn, talkers) should drop to ~2–4s via regex fast-path.**

